-- חוזר לבעלויות תשס"ז/1 — עדכון פרטי הבעלות לשליחת חוזרי היחידה (25.9.2006)
-- The Ministry asks every owning body to send, in a printed letter, the
-- details of the official its circulars are to be addressed to.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `עדכון פרטי הבעלות לשליחת חוזרי היחידה`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 The letterhead, title, date, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

§§ `The request`

@desc How the details may reach the department (¶13).
DECLARE `channel` IS ONE OF
    `by post`
    `by fax`

DECLARE `details action` IS ONE OF
    `send the details` HAS
        `details sent`    IS AN `owner contact details`
        `channel used`    IS A `channel`
        `a printed letter` IS A BOOLEAN

-- ¶11: each owning body is to send, in a printed letter, the details
-- listed below; ¶13: by post or by fax. The circular sets no deadline, so
-- the rule has none: the duty stands until it is done.
@ref akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `details action`
DECIDE `the owning body sends its details` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `send the details` d c printed
          PROVIDED printed AND `the details are complete` d

-- "the following details": a detail is given when it is not empty. The
-- box is optional (¶5 asks only "if there is one"); the other six are
-- required.
GIVEN d IS AN `owner contact details`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the details are complete` d IF
        NOT d's `name of the official the circular is addressed to` EQUALS ""
    AND NOT d's `title of the post` EQUALS ""
    AND NOT d's `name of the owning body` EQUALS ""
    AND NOT d's `telephone with area code` EQUALS ""
    AND NOT d's `street and house number` EQUALS ""
    AND NOT d's `city and postcode` EQUALS ""

§§ `The details asked for`

-- The six details ¶11 asks for, one field each; ¶5's second paragraph
-- asks, where there is a post-office box, whether it replaces the street
-- address or comes in addition to it.
DECLARE `owner contact details` HAS
    @ref akn:hc_1__para_1
    `name of the official the circular is addressed to` IS A STRING
    @ref akn:hc_1__para_2
    `title of the post`                                 IS A STRING  @desc e.g. head of human resources, comptroller
    @ref akn:hc_1__para_3
    `name of the owning body`                           IS A STRING
    `belongs to the Centre of Local Government`         IS A BOOLEAN @desc ¶3: whether the owning body belongs to מרכז השלטון המקומי
    @ref akn:hc_1__para_4
    `telephone with area code`                          IS A STRING
    @ref akn:hc_1__para_5
    `street and house number`                           IS A STRING
    @ref akn:hc_1__para_5/p2
    `post-office box`                                   IS A STRING  @desc empty where there is none
    `the box replaces the street address`               IS A BOOLEAN @desc ¶5: where there is a box, whether it is instead of the street address or in addition to it
    @ref akn:hc_1__para_6
    `city and postcode`                                 IS A STRING

-- akn:hc_1/p2 Information that the department's circulars are also posted on its website when issued; it informs and puts no duty on the owning body.

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and signature; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The details are invented placeholders.
`a filled-in letter` MEANS
    `owner contact details` WITH
        `name of the official the circular is addressed to` IS "A. Cohen"
        `title of the post`                                 IS "head of human resources"
        `name of the owning body`                           IS "a municipality"
        `belongs to the Centre of Local Government`         IS TRUE
        `telephone with area code`                          IS "02-0000000"
        `street and house number`                           IS "1 Main Street"
        `post-office box`                                   IS ""
        `the box replaces the street address`               IS FALSE
        `city and postcode`                                 IS "Jerusalem 90000"

`a letter with no telephone` MEANS
    `owner contact details` WITH
        `name of the official the circular is addressed to` IS "A. Cohen"
        `title of the post`                                 IS "comptroller"
        `name of the owning body`                           IS "a network"
        `belongs to the Centre of Local Government`         IS FALSE
        `telephone with area code`                          IS ""
        `street and house number`                           IS "1 Main Street"
        `post-office box`                                   IS "PO Box 1"
        `the box replaces the street address`               IS FALSE
        `city and postcode`                                 IS "Haifa 30000"

#ASSERT `the details are complete` `a filled-in letter`
#ASSERT NOT `the details are complete` `a letter with no telephone`

#TRACE `the owning body sends its details` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `send the details` `a filled-in letter` `by fax` TRUE AT 3
#TRACE `the owning body sends its details` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `send the details` `a letter with no telephone` `by post` TRUE AT 3

§§ `Property checks`

-- ¶11 over every combination of the seven details given or left empty,
-- with the box replacing the street or not: the details are complete
-- exactly when the six ¶11 asks for are all given; the post-office box,
-- which ¶5 asks for only "if there is one", never decides it.
`given or empty` MEANS LIST "x", ""
`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE

GIVEN a IS A STRING, b IS A STRING, c IS A STRING, t IS A STRING, s IS A STRING, p IS A STRING, x IS A STRING, r IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `owner contact details`
DECIDE `checked details` a b c t s p x r IS
    `owner contact details` WITH
        `name of the official the circular is addressed to` IS a
        `title of the post`                                 IS b
        `name of the owning body`                           IS c
        `belongs to the Centre of Local Government`         IS r
        `telephone with area code`                          IS t
        `street and house number`                           IS s
        `post-office box`                                   IS p
        `the box replaces the street address`               IS r
        `city and postcode`                                 IS x

#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD
                all (GIVEN b YIELD
                        all (GIVEN c YIELD
                                all (GIVEN t YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN s YIELD
                                                all (GIVEN p YIELD
                                                        all (GIVEN x YIELD
                                                                all (GIVEN r YIELD
                                                                        `the details are complete` (`checked details` a b c t s p x r)
                                                                        EQUALS all (GIVEN v YIELD NOT (v EQUALS "")) (LIST a, b, c, t, s, x))
                                                                    `both booleans`)
                                                            `given or empty`)
                                                    `given or empty`)
                                            `given or empty`)
                                    `given or empty`)
                            `given or empty`)
                    `given or empty`)
            `given or empty`
